  "objective": "Independently rebuild the M2 adapter artifact in a fresh worktree and reproduce the fail-closed evidence for the U1/U3 constructed-input consumers (adapters/UpstreamAdapters/DownstreamGeometry.lean, adapters/UpstreamAdaptersPetersen/DownstreamUse.lean).",
  "acceptance": "Work only in a fresh worktree, never in the producer worktree. With the pinned toolchain (leanprover/lean4:v4.32.1, mathlib 520045ab14e26149ee970e2e617ca04b09bde5d6, snapshot bb91a091f0b968f8bbe8d861e025a88d82b161be): (1) `lake build` in adapters/ and `lake build UpstreamAdaptersPetersen`, both exit 0; (2) `bash evidence/run-axiom-audit.sh` -> 79 declaration cones, every cone a subset of {propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound}, 0 sorryAx, CHECK_EXIT=0; (3) `python3 evidence/check-authored-files.py .` -> 15 authored files, 0 forbidden tokens; (4) `python3 evidence/source-hashes.py . evidence/source-hashes.json` -> sources_untouched true and source_tree_sha256 9a2b660a8c9c3940cf076512d70d7ee04997efc53d3ecabd5d1a8a149e3684af; (5) `python3 evidence/make-audit-file.py .` is idempotent on the committed Audit.lean files; (6) `lake env lean` re-checks the two general U1 theorems by name. Record for each step the exact command, exit code, wall time and log path; any mismatch is FAIL with the diff. Never edit third_party/, never flatten pins, no sorry/axiom/admit/unsafe/native_decide.",
  "host_pool": ["ophis-gpu"],
  "requires_lean": true,
  "max_hours": 3
}
